`500-513`: **Hard-coded Canvas file patterns**

The file patterns are hard-coded in the method. Consider externalizing these patterns for easier maintenance and configuration.



Consider using a configurable list or pattern:

```diff
+private static final Set<String> CANVAS_ENTITY_FILE_PATTERNS = new HashSet<>(Arrays.asList(
+    "assignment_settings.xml",
+    "course_settings.xml",
+    "assignment_groups.xml",
+    "files_meta.xml",
+    "late_policy.xml",
+    "context.xml",
+    "media_tracks.xml",
+    "canvas_export.txt",
+    "module_meta.xml",
+    "discussion_settings.xml",
+    "assessment_settings.xml",
+    "quiz_settings.xml"
+));
+
 private boolean isCanvasEntityFile(String fileHref) {
-    return fileHref.endsWith("assignment_settings.xml") ||
-           fileHref.endsWith("course_settings.xml") ||
-           fileHref.endsWith("assignment_groups.xml") ||
-           fileHref.endsWith("files_meta.xml") ||
-           fileHref.endsWith("late_policy.xml") ||
-           fileHref.endsWith("context.xml") ||
-           fileHref.endsWith("media_tracks.xml") ||
-           fileHref.endsWith("canvas_export.txt") ||
-           fileHref.endsWith("module_meta.xml") ||
-           fileHref.contains("discussion_settings.xml") ||
-           fileHref.contains("assessment_settings.xml") ||
-           fileHref.contains("quiz_settings.xml");
+    for (String pattern : CANVAS_ENTITY_FILE_PATTERNS) {
+        if (fileHref.endsWith(pattern) || fileHref.contains(pattern)) {
+            return true;
+        }
+    }
+    return false;
 }
```

