`742-756`: **Update submission type mapping to align with Canvas export values**

- Remove the `"not_graded"` check (that’s in `grading_type`, not `submission_types`).  
- Map `online_upload` or `online_url` to `ATTACHMENT_ONLY_ASSIGNMENT_SUBMISSION`.  
- Map `none` and `on_paper` to `NON_ELECTRONIC_ASSIGNMENT_SUBMISSION`.  
- Add explicit branches for:
  - `external_tool` → `EXTERNAL_TOOL_SUBMISSION`  
  - `media_recording` → `VIDEO_SUBMISSION`  
- Leave `discussion_topic`, `online_quiz`, and `student_annotation` unhandled for now—please confirm whether to skip them or map to an existing enum.  
- Consider if `SINGLE_ATTACHMENT_SUBMISSION` should apply to any of these cases.

```diff
-            String submissionTypes = assignmentXml.getChildText("submission_types", canvasNs);
-            Assignment.SubmissionType submitType = Assignment.SubmissionType.TEXT_AND_ATTACHMENT_ASSIGNMENT_SUBMISSION; // default
-            if (submissionTypes != null) {
-                if ("not_graded".equals(submissionTypes)) {
-                    submitType = Assignment.SubmissionType.ASSIGNMENT_SUBMISSION_TYPE_NONE;
-                } else if (submissionTypes.contains("online_text_entry") && submissionTypes.contains("online_upload")) {
-                    submitType = Assignment.SubmissionType.TEXT_AND_ATTACHMENT_ASSIGNMENT_SUBMISSION;
-                } else if (submissionTypes.contains("online_text_entry")) {
-                    submitType = Assignment.SubmissionType.TEXT_ONLY_ASSIGNMENT_SUBMISSION;
-                } else if (submissionTypes.contains("online_upload")) {
-                    submitType = Assignment.SubmissionType.ATTACHMENT_ONLY_ASSIGNMENT_SUBMISSION;
-                }
-            }
+            String submissionTypes = assignmentXml.getChildText("submission_types", canvasNs);
+            Assignment.SubmissionType submitType = Assignment.SubmissionType.TEXT_AND_ATTACHMENT_ASSIGNMENT_SUBMISSION; // default
+            if (submissionTypes != null) {
+                if (submissionTypes.contains("online_text_entry") && submissionTypes.contains("online_upload")) {
+                    submitType = Assignment.SubmissionType.TEXT_AND_ATTACHMENT_ASSIGNMENT_SUBMISSION;
+                } else if (submissionTypes.contains("online_text_entry")) {
+                    submitType = Assignment.SubmissionType.TEXT_ONLY_ASSIGNMENT_SUBMISSION;
+                } else if (submissionTypes.contains("online_upload") || submissionTypes.contains("online_url")) {
+                    submitType = Assignment.SubmissionType.ATTACHMENT_ONLY_ASSIGNMENT_SUBMISSION;
+                } else if (submissionTypes.contains("none") || submissionTypes.contains("on_paper")) {
+                    submitType = Assignment.SubmissionType.NON_ELECTRONIC_ASSIGNMENT_SUBMISSION;
+                } else if (submissionTypes.contains("external_tool")) {
+                    submitType = Assignment.SubmissionType.EXTERNAL_TOOL_SUBMISSION;
+                } else if (submissionTypes.contains("media_recording")) {
+                    submitType = Assignment.SubmissionType.VIDEO_SUBMISSION;
+                }
+                // discussion_topic, online_quiz, student_annotation: TBD – please advise
+            }
             a.setTypeOfSubmission(submitType);
```

