`292-301`: **Optional a11y: keyboard support and initial ARIA state sync**

- Add delegated keydown (Enter/Space) handling so toggles are operable via keyboard.
- On DOM ready, set aria-expanded on all toggles to reflect current open/closed state.




Example follow-ups:

```js
// Keyboard support
sidebar.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
  const toggle = e.target.closest('.dropdown-toggle.dropdown-navIntraTool');
  if (!toggle || !sidebar.contains(toggle)) return;
  if (e.key !== 'Enter' && e.key !== ' ') return;
  e.preventDefault();
  toggle.click();
});

// Initial ARIA sync
sidebar.querySelectorAll('.dropdown-toggle.dropdown-navIntraTool').forEach(t => {
  const container = t.closest('.navIntraTool');
  const open = !!container?.querySelector('ul.navIntraTool.navIntraToolMobile.dropdown-active');
  t.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');
});
```

