`110-134`: **Keep the dedup snippet aligned with the kernel.**

The code sample deletes a previously-saved body via delResourceBodyFilesystem. With pre-write hashing + temp staging, we either reuse an existing FILE_PATH or copy from temp; no need to delete a just-written final blob.


```diff
