`1501-1542`: **DRY: Extract shared syllabus-import logic and reuse for both branches**

The LAR syllabus block largely duplicates the earlier webcontent syllabus block (Lines 1056–1103). Extract into a private helper to reduce divergence and future bugs.


Example helper (apply outside this hunk):

```java
private void importCanvasSyllabus(Element resourceXml, Element itemXml, CartridgeLoader loader) {
    final String resourceId = resourceXml.getAttributeValue(IDENTIFIER);
    final String syllabusKey = "syllabus:" + resourceId;
    if (itemsAdded.get(syllabusKey) != null || syllabusManager == null) return;

    String title = itemXml != null ? itemXml.getChildText(CC_ITEM_TITLE, ns.getNs()) : "Canvas Syllabus";
    String html = readHtmlFromResource(resourceXml, loader);
    FormattedText ft = ComponentManager.get(FormattedText.class);
    StringBuilder errs = new StringBuilder();
    html = ft.processFormattedText(html, errs);
    if (StringUtils.isBlank(html)) return;

    SyllabusItem item = syllabusManager.getSyllabusItemByContextId(siteId);
    if (item == null) item = syllabusManager.createSyllabusItem(simplePageBean.getCurrentUserId(), siteId, null);
    int pos = syllabusManager.findLargestSyllabusPosition(item) + 1;
    syllabusManager.createSyllabusDataObject(title, pos, html, "yes", SyllabusData.ITEM_POSTED, "none", null, null, false, null, null, item);
    itemsAdded.put(syllabusKey, SimplePageItem.DUMMY);
    log.debug("Created Canvas syllabus entry: {}", title);
}

private String readHtmlFromResource(Element resourceXml, CartridgeLoader loader) {
    for (Element f : resourceXml.getChildren(FILE, ns.getNs())) {
        String href = f.getAttributeValue(HREF);
        if (StringUtils.endsWithIgnoreCase(href, ".html") || StringUtils.endsWithIgnoreCase(href, ".htm")) {
            try (InputStream in = loader.getFile(href)) {
                if (in != null) return new String(in.readAllBytes(), StandardCharsets.UTF_8);
            } catch (Exception e) {
                log.warn("Failed to load Canvas syllabus HTML: {}", href, e);
            }
        }
    }
    return "";
}
```

Then replace both inlined syllabus blocks with:
