`357-368`: **Add fallback to streamed copy when server-side copy isn’t supported**

As written, UnsupportedOperationException from providers without server-side copy will bubble and fail the copy. Wrap copyBlob in try/catch and stream as a fallback, preserving destination metadata. 



```diff
-        // Server-side copy with metadata override so the destination reflects destId/destFilePath
-        // Encode id similarly to saveInputStream to satisfy provider metadata charset restrictions
-        String asciiID = Base64.encodeBase64String(destId.getBytes("UTF8"));
-        CopyOptions opts = buildCopyOptionsWithUserMetadata(ImmutableMap.of("id", asciiID, "path", destFilePath));
-        store.copyBlob(src.container, src.name, dst.container, dst.name, opts);
+        // Server-side copy with metadata override so the destination reflects destId/destFilePath
+        // Encode id similarly to saveInputStream to satisfy provider metadata charset restrictions
+        String asciiID = Base64.encodeBase64String(destId.getBytes("UTF8"));
+        CopyOptions opts = buildCopyOptionsWithUserMetadata(ImmutableMap.of("id", asciiID, "path", destFilePath));
+        try {
+            store.copyBlob(src.container, src.name, dst.container, dst.name, opts);
+        } catch (UnsupportedOperationException uoe) {
+            // Fallback: stream via this JVM while preserving metadata
+            Blob srcBlob = store.getBlob(src.container, src.name);
+            if (srcBlob == null) {
+                throw new IOException("Source object not found for copy: " + src.container + "/" + src.name, uoe);
+            }
+            Payload payload = srcBlob.getPayload();
+            try {
+                Long size = (srcBlob.getMetadata() != null) ? srcBlob.getMetadata().getSize() : null;
+                Blob dest = (size != null)
+                    ? store.blobBuilder(dst.name)
+                        .payload(payload)
+                        .contentLength(size)
+                        .userMetadata(ImmutableMap.of("id", asciiID, "path", destFilePath))
+                        .build()
+                    : store.blobBuilder(dst.name)
+                        .payload(payload)
+                        .userMetadata(ImmutableMap.of("id", asciiID, "path", destFilePath))
+                        .build();
+                store.putBlob(dst.container, dest);
+            } finally {
+                payload.release();
+            }
+        }
```

