> 1. **`sourcedId` path inconsistency (likely typo/pre‑existing bug)**  
>    In `doPostXml` you extract the main `sourcedid` from `bodyMap.get("/resultRecord/sourcedGUID/sourcedId")`, but in `processOutcomeXml` you build the response’s `Result.sourcedId` from `bodyMap.get("/resultRecord/result/sourcedId")`. This path mismatch means the response’s `sourcedId` will typically be `null` even when the request carried a valid sourced GUID.
> 
