For `GradeType.LETTER`, every assignment adds the same `maxPoints` value, so `points.size()` will always be ≤ 1 whenever there is at least one assignment. That means the “different points” check no longer disables drop/keep options for categories whose assignments have different `a.getPoints()` values.

