> The `RefreshAuthzGroupTask` continues running after `destroy()` closes the caches (`authzUserGroupIdsCache`, `maintainRolesCache`, `realmLocksCache`), causing potential `NullPointerException` or other errors. The `SchedulingService.scheduleWithFixedDelay()` returns a `ScheduledFuture<?>` that must be stored and cancelled in `destroy()`. Also consider cancelling any previous task if `init()` is called multiple times.
> 
