<details>
<summary>♻️ Extract shared toXml into FoormBaseBean</summary>

Add a helper in `FoormBaseBean`:

```java
protected Element toXml(Document doc, Stack<Element> stack, String tagName) {
    if (doc == null) {
        return null;
    }
    Element el = toArchiveElement(doc, tagName);
    if (el == null) {
        return null;
    }
    if (stack == null || stack.isEmpty()) {
        doc.appendChild(el);
    } else {
        stack.peek().appendChild(el);
    }
    if (stack != null) {
        stack.push(el);
        stack.pop();
    }
    return el;
}
```

Then in each bean:

```java
public Element toXml(Document doc, Stack<Element> stack) {
    return toXml(doc, stack, LTIService.ARCHIVE_LTI_TOOL_TAG);
}
